WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.855 --> 00:00:05.846
The day list shows today's appointments, per service.

2
00:00:05.846 --> 00:00:09.796
Someone arrived: mark them as attended.

3
00:00:09.796 --> 00:00:13.361
Someone did not come: mark them as not attended.

4
00:00:13.361 --> 00:00:17.846
The desk can send a fresh invitation to book again.

5
00:00:17.846 --> 00:00:28.126
An appointment can be cancelled with a reason; the user gets an e-mail.

6
00:00:28.126 --> 00:00:33.040
Cancelled appointments stay listed below the day, with the reason.

